&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a 4-month contract. This position is for temporary engagement through our staffing partner, Yoh Enterprise Solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a talented and detail-oriented Capture Artist to join our team on a temporary contract basis to support the creation of marketing and promotional materials, in addition to in game and social content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Capture Artist will be responsible for capturing high-quality gameplay footage and&amp;nbsp;screenshots that showcase gameplay features and game modes. This role requires a strong&amp;nbsp;understanding of video game mechanics, visual storytelling, and production workflows. The ideal&amp;nbsp;candidate is passionate about gaming and possesses excellent attention to detail, an eye for&amp;nbsp;good shot composition and can work efficiently in a fast-paced production environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture high-quality gameplay footage and screenshots across various game modes and gameplay scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create visually compelling gameplay moments that highlight key features, mechanics, and player experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage and execute specific gameplay scenarios based on creative briefs and marketing requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with debug game builds and capture hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate various recording devices to capture gameplay.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and manage recording settings to meet project specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot game builds, hardware, and software issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organization of captured assets, including proper naming conventions and file management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboratio&lt;/strong&gt;n&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Producers, Creative Directors, Game Developers, Marketing, and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Editorial teams to fulfill content requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in capture planning sessions and creative reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate progress, challenges, and asset status to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asset Managemen&lt;/strong&gt;t&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize captured assets and distribute to editorial personnel both on-site and remote.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate records of builds, capture settings, and content requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all deliverables meet quality and technical standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualification&lt;/strong&gt;s&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with debug builds and camera controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General computer proficiency on Mac and PC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Adobe Premiere and Media Encoder a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent attention to detail and ability to follow creative direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and asset management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects and deadlines simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a collaborative, fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player with a positive and productive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At SIE, working with our partners, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the individual base pay range may vary based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role is eligible for benefit offerings that include medical, dental, and vision. Click &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dzconnex.com/summary-of-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below, this is an hourly rate.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$35 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
